    3. For each blue cell, randomly assign to left-only, right-only, or both (ensuring both-only >= 1, left-only >= 1, right-only >= 1, and each mask density 30-60%)
    4. Build left mask (orange where assigned left or both, else black) and right mask (orange where assigned right or both, else black)
    5. Assemble input as [left | red_column | right] of size H x (2*W+1)
